ass='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja472:10.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:10.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:10.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:10.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja472:11.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:11.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:11.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:11.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja472:12.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:12.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:12.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:12.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja472:13.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:13.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:13.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:13.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja472:14.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:14.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:14.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:14.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja472:15.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:15.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:15.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:15.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:15.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja472:15.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja472:16.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja472:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja472:0.2": "Dvādasakanipāta ", "ja472:0.3": "Cūḷakuṇālavagga ", "ja472:0.4": "9. Mahāpadumajātaka ", "ja472:1.1": "“Nādaṭṭhā parato dosaṁ, ", "ja472:1.2": "aṇuṁthūlāni sabbaso; ", "ja472:1.3": "Issaro paṇaye daṇḍaṁ, ", "ja472:1.4": "sāmaṁ appaṭivekkhiya. ", "ja472:2.1": "Yo ca appaṭivekkhitvā, ", "ja472:2.2": "daṇḍaṁ kubbati khattiyo; ", "ja472:2.3": "Sakaṇṭakaṁ so gilati, ", "ja472:2.4": "jaccandhova samakkhikaṁ. ", "ja472:3.1": "Adaṇḍiyaṁ daṇḍayati, ", "ja472:3.2": "daṇḍiyañca adaṇḍiyaṁ; ", "ja472:3.3": "Andhova visamaṁ maggaṁ, ", "ja472:3.4": "na jānāti samāsamaṁ. ", "ja472:4.1": "Yo ca etāni ṭhānāni, ", "ja472:4.2": "Aṇuṁthūlāni sabbaso; ", "ja472:4.3": "Sudiṭṭhamanusāseyya, ", "ja472:4.4": "Sa ve voharitumarahati. ", "ja472:5.1": "Nekantamudunā sakkā, ", "ja472:5.2": "Ekantatikhiṇena vā; ", "ja472:5.3": "Attaṁ mahante ṭhapetuṁ, ", "ja472:5.4": "Tasmā ubhayamācare. ", "ja472:6.1": "Paribhūto mudu hoti, ", "ja472:6.2": "atitikkho ca veravā; ", "ja472:6.3": "Etañca ubhayaṁ ñatvā, ", "ja472:6.4": "anumajjhaṁ samācare. ", "ja472:7.1": "Bahumpi ratto bhāseyya, ", "ja472:7.2": "duṭṭhopi bahu bhāsati; ", "ja472:7.3": "Na itthikāraṇā rāja, ", "ja472:7.4": "puttaṁ ghātetumarahasi”. ", "ja472:8.1": "“Sabbova loko ekato, ", "ja472:8.2": "Itthī ca ayamekikā; ", "ja472:8.3": "Tenāhaṁ paṭipajjissaṁ, ", "ja472:8.4": "Gacchatha pakkhipatheva taṁ”. ", "ja472:9.1": "“Anekatāle narake, ", "ja472:9.2": "gambhīre ca suduttare; ", "ja472:9.3": "Pātito giriduggasmiṁ, ", "ja472:9.4": "kena tvaṁ tattha nāmari”. ", "ja472:10.1": "“Nāgo jātaphaṇo tattha, ", "ja472:10.2": "thāmavā girisānujo; ", "ja472:10.3": "Paccaggahi maṁ bhogehi, ", "ja472:10.4": "tenāhaṁ tattha nāmariṁ”. ", "ja472:11.1": "“Ehi taṁ paṭinessāmi, ", "ja472:11.2": "rājaputta sakaṁ gharaṁ; ", "ja472:11.3": "Rajjaṁ kārehi bhaddante, ", "ja472:11.4": "kiṁ araññe karissasi”. ", "ja472:12.1": "“Yathā gilitvā baḷisaṁ, ", "ja472:12.2": "Uddhareyya salohitaṁ; ", "ja472:12.3": "Uddharitvā sukhī assa, ", "ja472:12.4": "Evaṁ passāmi attanaṁ”. ", "ja472:13.1": "“Kiṁ nu tvaṁ baḷisaṁ brūsi, ", "ja472:13.2": "kiṁ tvaṁ brūsi salohitaṁ; ", "ja472:13.3": "Kiṁ nu tvaṁ ubbhataṁ brūsi, ", "ja472:13.4": "taṁ me akkhāhi pucchito”. ", "ja472:14.1": "“Kāmāhaṁ baḷisaṁ brūmi, ", "ja472:14.2": "hatthiassaṁ salohitaṁ; ", "ja472:14.3": "Cattāhaṁ ubbhataṁ brūmi, ", "ja472:14.4": "evaṁ jānāhi khattiya”. ", "ja472:15.1": "“Ciñcamāṇavikā mātā, ", "ja472:15.2": "devadatto ca me pitā; ", "ja472:15.3": "Ānando paṇḍito nāgo, ", "ja472:15.4": "sāriputto ca devatā; ", "ja472:15.5": "Rājaputto ahaṁ āsiṁ, ", "ja472:15.6": "evaṁ dhāretha jātakan”ti. ", "ja472:16.1": "Mahāpadumajātakaṁ navamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja472:0.1": "", "ja472:0.2": "", "ja472:0.3": "", "ja472:0.4": "", "ja472:1.1": "Nādaṭṭhā → nādiṭṭhā (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja472:1.2": "", "ja472:1.3": "", "ja472:1.4": "", "ja472:2.1": "", "ja472:2.2": "", "ja472:2.3": "", "ja472:2.4": "", "ja472:3.1": "daṇḍayati → daṇḍiyati (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja472:3.2": "adaṇḍiyaṁ → adaṇḍiya (nissya); na daṇḍaye (?) ", "ja472:3.3": "", "ja472:3.4": "", "ja472:4.1": "", "ja472:4.2": "", "ja472:4.3": "", "ja472:4.4": "voharitumarahati → vohātum arahati (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja472:5.1": "", "ja472:5.2": "", "ja472:5.3": "mahante → mahatte (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) | ṭhapetuṁ → ṭhāpetuṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja472:5.4": "", "ja472:6.1": "", "ja472:6.2": "", "ja472:6.3": "", "ja472:6.4": "", "ja472:7.1": "", "ja472:7.2": "", "ja472:7.3": "", "ja472:7.4": "", "ja472:8.1": "Sabbova → sabbo ca (bj, pts-vp-pli1) | ekato → ekanto (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja472:8.2": "", "ja472:8.3": "", "ja472:8.4": "pakkhipatheva → pakkhipetha (sya-a) ", "ja472:9.1": "", "ja472:9.2": "gambhīre ca suduttare → gambhīre ca duruttare (sya1ed, sya2ed); gambhīre suduruttare (pts-vp-pli1, mr) ", "ja472:9.3": "", "ja472:9.4": "", "ja472:10.1": "", "ja472:10.2": "", "ja472:10.3": "", "ja472:10.4": "", "ja472:11.1": "", "ja472:11.2": "", "ja472:11.3": "kārehi → kāresi (bj) ", "ja472:11.4": "", "ja472:12.1": "", "ja472:12.2": "", "ja472:12.3": "", "ja472:12.4": "Evaṁ → sukhaṁ (pts-vp-pli1, mr) | attanaṁ → attanā (sya1ed, sya2ed); attani (pts-vp-pli1, mr) evaṁ ahampi puna sotthibhāvappattaṁ gilitabaḷisaṁ purisamiva attānaṁ passāmīti (aṭṭha. saṁvaṇṇanā) ", "ja472:13.1": "", "ja472:13.2": "", "ja472:13.3": "", "ja472:13.4": "", "ja472:14.1": "", "ja472:14.2": "", "ja472:14.3": "", "ja472:14.4": "", "ja472:15.1": "", "ja472:15.2": "", "ja472:15.3": "", "ja472:15.4": "", "ja472:15.5": "Rājaputto ahaṁ āsiṁ → ahaṁ tadā rājaputto (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja472:15.6": "", "ja472:16.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja472:0.1": "", "ja472:0.2": "", "ja472:0.3": "", "ja472:0.4": "", "ja472:1.1": "ms22J_2352, msdiv106, ndp22.246, pts-vp-pli4.192", "ja472:1.2": "", "ja472:1.3": "", "ja472:1.4": "", "ja472:2.1": "dr27.337, ms22J_2353, msdiv107", "ja472:2.2": "", "ja472:2.3": "", "ja472:2.4": "", "ja472:3.1": "ms22J_2354, msdiv108", "ja472:3.2": "", "ja472:3.3": "", "ja472:3.4": "", "ja472:4.1": "ms22J_2355, msdiv109", "ja472:4.2": "", "ja472:4.3": "", "ja472:4.4": "", "ja472:5.1": "csp1ed22.254, csp2ed22.254, ms22J_2356, msdiv110, sya27.339", "ja472:5.2": "", "ja472:5.3": "", "ja472:5.4": "", "ja472:6.1": "bj30.436, ms22J_2357, msdiv111", "ja472:6.2": "", "ja472:6.3": "", "ja472:6.4": "", "ja472:7.1": "ms22J_2358, msdiv112", "ja472:7.2": "", "ja472:7.3": "", "ja472:7.4": "", "ja472:8.1": "ms22J_2359, msdiv113, pts-vp-pli4.193, vri68.197", "ja472:8.2": "", "ja472:8.3": "", "ja472:8.4": "", "ja472:9.1": "ms22J_2360, msdiv114, pts-vp-pli4.195", "ja472:9.2": "", "ja472:9.3": "", "ja472:9.4": "", "ja472:10.1": "ms22J_2361, msdiv115", "ja472:10.2": "", "ja472:10.3": "", "ja472:10.4": "", "ja472:11.1": "dr27.338, ms22J_2362, msdiv116", "ja472:11.2": "", "ja472:11.3": "", "ja472:11.4": "", "ja472:12.1": "ms22J_2363, msdiv117, ndp22.247", "ja472:12.2": "", "ja472:12.3": "", "ja472:12.4": "", "ja472:13.1": "ms22J_2364, msdiv118", "ja472:13.2": "", "ja472:13.3": "", "ja472:13.4": "", "ja472:14.1": "ms22J_2365, msdiv119", "ja472:14.2": "", "ja472:14.3": "", "ja472:14.4": "", "ja472:15.1": "ms22J_2366, msdiv120, pts-vp-pli4.196, sya27.340", "ja472:15.2": "", "ja472:15.3": "", "ja472:15.4": "", "ja472:15.5": "", "ja472:15.6": "", "ja472:16.1": "ms22J_2367"}, "keys_order": ["ja472:0.1", "ja472:0.2", "ja472:0.3", "ja472:0.4", 